{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>עשוק אפרים</b> — His kings oppressed him and exalted him." "<b>כי הואיל הלך</b> — Two verbs in a row, like: הגשם חלף הלך לו. For it means: because he willingly went after the command of men, and it is צו in the sense of צו לצו. And Yefet said: because Ephraim will be oppressed by the nations."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {1 "הואיל interpreted as 'willingly'; the word functions as a verb according to Ibn Ezra's argument."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:18.249491239Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}